---
import BaseLayout from '@/layout/base-layout.astro'

const title = "Welcome to Money Wit Lite";
const description = "You're in. Your first edition of Money Wit Lite arrives this Sunday.";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white antialiased">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-24 pt-16 md:pt-24">

      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FDD817]">
          <svg
            class="h-4 w-4 text-[#0a0a0a]"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="4"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#FDD817]">Payment confirmed</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
        You're in. Welcome to the <span class="italic text-[#FDD817]">Money Wit Lite.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">
        Your subscription is active. The first edition lands in your inbox this Sunday, clear, credible, and concise.
      </p>

      <section class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-[#FDD817]/20 bg-[#FDD817]/5 p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FDD817]">A note from Oler</span>
          <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#FDD817]/20"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-white/85">
          <p>Over the years, I've received repeated requests to share the stock options, recommendations, and investment decisions I'm currently looking at.</p>
          <p>I've decided to start doing that every Sunday, straight to your inbox. The Money Wit Lite edition is built around one idea: your weekly investing signal, delivered in a way that is clear, credible, and concise.</p>
          <p>Here's what you can expect each Sunday:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-[#FDD817]"></span>
              <span>A short market review of what moved, what mattered, and what's next.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-[#FDD817]"></span>
              <span>Investment recommendations drawn from my live portfolio and the work I do behind the scenes.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-[#FDD817]"></span>
              <span>One clear move you can think through before Monday opens.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>No hype. No noise. Just the signal I wish I had when I started.</p>
          <p class="font-medium text-white">See you Sunday.<br />— Oler</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50">When it arrives</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">Every Sunday, around 7:00am WAT. First edition: this Sunday.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50">Make sure it lands</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-white/40">
        A confirmation email has been sent to you. If you don't see it in the next few minutes, check your spam or promotions folder.
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
